# Complete OpenWA API Documentation & Usage Guide

This document lists the most important API endpoints available in OpenWA, what they do, and how to use them in your own application.

---

## 1. Global Requirements
Every API request MUST include your API key and set the content type.

**Headers:**
```http
x-api-key: owa_k1_65773c7ed4145c829caa28030ef72d0f37ce4417d30c87f022da1ed351d067e2
Content-Type: application/json
```

**Formatting Chat IDs:**
- **Individuals:** Number + `@c.us` (e.g., `919512446126@c.us`)
- **Groups:** Group Number + `@g.us` (e.g., `1203630283456789@g.us`)

