## 3. Messaging API
Use these APIs to send different types of messages once your session is `READY`.

### Send a Text Message
*   **Method:** `POST /api/sessions/{sessionId}/messages/send-text`
*   **Body:**
```json
{
  "chatId": "919512446126@c.us",
  "text": "Hello world!"
}
```

### Send an Image
*   **Method:** `POST /api/sessions/{sessionId}/messages/send-image`
*   **Body:**
```json
{
  "chatId": "919512446126@c.us",
  "file": {
    "url": "https://example.com/image.jpg"
  },
  "caption": "Look at this image!"
}
```

### Send a Video
*   **Method:** `POST /api/sessions/{sessionId}/messages/send-video`
*   **Body:**
```json
{
  "chatId": "919512446126@c.us",
  "file": {
    "url": "https://example.com/video.mp4"
  },
  "caption": "Watch this video!"
}
```

### Send a Document / PDF
*   **Method:** `POST /api/sessions/{sessionId}/messages/send-document`
*   **Body:**
```json
{
  "chatId": "919512446126@c.us",
  "file": {
    "url": "https://example.com/invoice.pdf"
  },
  "fileName": "Invoice_Aug2026.pdf"
}
```

### Send a Location
*   **Method:** `POST /api/sessions/{sessionId}/messages/send-location`
*   **Body:**
```json
{
  "chatId": "919512446126@c.us",
  "latitude": 37.7749,
  "longitude": -122.4194,
  "name": "Golden Gate Bridge"
}
```

