## 4. Contacts & Groups API

### Check if a number is on WhatsApp
Verifies if a phone number actually has a registered WhatsApp account.
*   **Method:** `GET /api/sessions/{sessionId}/contacts/check/{number}`
*   *(Note: Put the raw number with country code in the URL, e.g., `/check/919512446126`)*

### Get all Contacts
Fetches a list of all saved contacts from your phone.
*   **Method:** `GET /api/sessions/{sessionId}/contacts`

### Get all Groups
Fetches a list of all groups you are a participant in.
*   **Method:** `GET /api/sessions/{sessionId}/groups`

### Create a Group
Creates a brand new WhatsApp group.
*   **Method:** `POST /api/sessions/{sessionId}/groups`
*   **Body:**
```json
{
  "title": "My New C# Group",
  "participants": ["919512446126@c.us"]
}
```

### Leave a Group
Leaves an existing group.
*   **Method:** `POST /api/sessions/{sessionId}/groups/{groupId}/leave`
*   **Body:** *(Empty)*
